**Overall Status: PASS**

---

## 6. Conclusion

The Wokwi simulation successfully demonstrates the core functionality of the Smart Dustbin system.

The system can monitor waste level, calculate fill percentage, detect a nearby hand, automatically control the lid, generate full-bin alerts, display information locally, and transmit monitoring data to ThingSpeak through Wi-Fi.